			"Message": "style(Echo): Normalize whitespace and formatting in example files and tsconfig\n\nRemove extraneous blank lines after function signatures, struct definitions, impl blocks, and import groups across all Echo example files (Common/Read, Common/Write, Sequence, Tauri, WorkSteal). Reorganize imports with consistent grouping and spacing. Reformat tsconfig.json arrays (lib, types, include) to multi-line style for consistency.\n\nThis continues the whitespace normalization started in the previous commit, ensuring uniform formatting conventions across the Echo task scheduler examples and configuration.",
